# Trivy ignore file for the metric-hub MCP server image.
#
# Each entry must be a specific CVE with a justification and, ideally, a review
# date. Only suppress vulnerabilities that are genuinely not applicable — never
# to silence a real runtime exposure.

# jaraco.context / wheel path-traversal + malicious-archive CVEs. Both live only
# in setuptools' vendored build tooling (setuptools/_vendor/*) and are exploitable
# only when *building/installing* from an attacker-controlled archive. This server
# never processes untrusted tar/wheel archives at runtime, so they are not
# reachable in the deployed workload. Durable fix: a build-tool-free runtime image.
CVE-2026-23949
CVE-2026-24049

